# How to Use This Document

This is the single daily-reference document for On The Boulevard Shopping Center. It consolidates all property facts, operational procedures, emergency protocols, compliance calendar, and the live action-item TODO into one file. Sections are organized for both daily reference (look up a contact, find a procedure) and audit reference (point a counterparty at a single source).

### Document Map

- **§1–§4 **— Property facts, entity structure, tenant roster, parking & licenses (the 'what')

- **§5–§7 **— Floor plans, ops tool, brand (the property's documented assets)

- **§8 **— Financial snapshot & banking

- **§9 **— Vendor & service directory

- **§10 **— Operations manual & SOPs (rent collection, eviction, service requests, approval matrix)

- **§11 **— Insurance & risk management

- **§12 ****— Emergency ****&**** hurricane response plan (KEEP ACCESSIBLE)**

- **§13 **— Legal & compliance reference (LA + federal)

- **§14 **— Physical plant inventory

- **§15 **— Master compliance calendar

- **§16 **— SOT folder hierarchy & file inventory

- **§17 **— SOT workbook anomalies (open items)

- **§18 ****— Sequenced TODO with priorities**

- **§19–§20 **— Open questions, change log

