## 8.3 CAM Methodology Snapshot

Per SOT, NNN charges currently itemized as CAM $2.10/SF, Tax $0.85–$1.20/SF, Insurance $1.00–$1.95/SF across the portfolio. Tax and insurance components vary by lease vintage. Full CAM documentation pending.

- CAM pool composition documented (year-over-year)

- Pro-rata share calculation per tenant validated

- Cap / stop tracking per tenant lease

- Exclusions documented (capital, leasing commissions, owner overhead)

- Annual reconciliation calendar set (within 90–120 days of year-end)

- Tenant audit-rights window tracked

## 8.4 Reporting Cadence

- Monthly — P&L, balance sheet, rent roll, AR aging, variance to budget, leasing pipeline

- Quarterly — capex tracking, vendor performance, lease expiration calendar

- Annual — budget, CAM reconciliation, insurance review, capital plan, property tax appeal evaluation

