### 9.1 Vendor Onboarding Requirements

- Signed Master Services Agreement or vendor work order

- W-9 on file (for 1099 reporting)

- Certificate of Insurance — Belle Realty of Lafayette, LLC named additional insured

- Minimum coverage: $1M / $2M CGL; workers' comp per LA law

- Auto liability for any vehicle activity on site

- Background check confirmation for after-hours access

# 10. Operations Manual & SOPs

## 10.1 Rent Collection

- Rent due: 1st of month

- Grace period: per individual lease (typically 5 days)

- Late fee: per individual lease

- Auto-pay via DoorLoop tenant portal preferred

- ACH / wire / check accepted; cash discouraged

- Collections workflow: Day 1 statement → Day 6 reminder → Day 11 late notice → Day 16 default notice

## 10.2 Default & Eviction Workflow

*Louisiana is a civil-law jurisdiction. Eviction procedure differs from common-law states. Use LA-licensed counsel for any action beyond standard notice.*

- Day 1: auto-reminder via DoorLoop

- Day 11: late fee assessed per lease

- Day 16: default notice sent (Belle Realty letterhead, certified mail + email)

- Day 21: cure deadline lapses

- Day 22+: file Rule for Possession in City Court of Lafayette or appropriate venue

- Coordinate with LA counsel before filing

- Document every step — dates, certified mail receipts, photos, payment records

## 10.3 Service Request Workflow

- Tenant submits via DoorLoop portal, email, or phone

- PM logs in DoorLoop maintenance module within 24 hours

- PM triage: landlord vs tenant responsibility per lease

- Landlord items: dispatch vendor with PO

- Tenant items: notify tenant in writing

- Emergencies: immediate dispatch via 24/7 vendor list

- Close ticket in DoorLoop with vendor invoice + tenant confirmation

## 10.4 Approval Matrix

| **Action Type** | **Required Approval** |
| --- | --- |
| **Routine repairs ****<**** $500** | PM (Orange Ocean) |
| **Repairs $500–$2,500** | PM with same-day notice to owner |
| **Repairs $2,500–$5,000** | Owner (Belle Realty) email approval |
| **Capital expenditures ****>**** $5,000** | Owner written approval |
| **New lease execution** | Owner signature |
| **Lease amendment / extension** | Owner signature |
| **Default notice issuance** | Owner / counsel review |
| **Eviction filing** | Owner + LA counsel |
| **Vendor onboarding (new MSA)** | Owner approval |
| **Insurance claims ****>**** $10,000** | Owner direct involvement |
| **Tenant lease concessions** | Owner written approval |
| **Sublease / assignment consent** | Owner + counsel review |

