# 16. SOT Folder Hierarchy & File Inventory

## 16.1 SOT Folder Hierarchy

All property files organized under the Belle Realty SOT structure with 11 top-level categories:

- 00_ADMIN_AND_PROPERTY_WIDE — Master templates (ACH forms, default notices, estoppels, insurance templates, LOIs, lease templates, Schedule G templates, TI addenda, vendor agreements).

- 01_PHYSICAL_UNIT_MASTER — Per-unit subfolders: 01_Lease, 02_Insurance, 03_HVAC, 04_Maintenance, 05_Photos, 06_FloorPlans, 99_Archive.

- 02_ACTIVE_TENANTS — Tenant-specific files keyed by current occupant.

- 03_VACANCY_AND_LEASING — Active LOIs, marketing collateral, broker materials.

- 04_VENDOR — Service vendor contracts, COIs, contact info.

- 05_FINANCIALS — Rent rolls, financial statements, AR/AP, lender docs.

- 06_INSURANCE — Master property COIs, tenant COIs, claims history.

- 07_CAPEX — Capital projects, roof history, parking lot history, signage.

- 08_LEGAL — Title, litigation, easements, cross-parking license originals.

- 09_ARCHIVE — Superseded versions.

- 10_AI_EXPORTS — JSON exports from ops tool, AI-generated deliverables.

